# Platform Global Control Plane

## Role

Platform is Aipify Group AS **business control plane**.

- Platform sets global standards and oversees customers, finance, partners, product, operations, and governance.
- Core automates distribution.
- Customer APP handles customer workflows.

## Rules

1. Reuse existing authoritative data — never create parallel customer, finance, or partner models.
2. Prefer hubs and navigation organization over rebuilding Production surfaces.
3. No manual per-customer duplication of global templates when Core can distribute.
4. Dynamic global locales via `LOCALES` / `getPlatformControlPlaneLocales()` — no hardcoded Platform locale list.
5. English fallback; never show raw translation keys, enums, or ISO timestamps in primary UI.
6. Platform copy is administrative (this global template, affected customers, authoritative status) — not customer-facing onboarding copy.
7. Desktop-first wide layout; semantic colors; status not color-only.
8. Data freshness must be visible; null/unavailable metrics show “No data” / “Not connected” — never fake zero or fake health.
9. Exceptions over manual normal flow — exception queue links to existing authoritative surfaces.
10. Finance actions (payment, invoice create, commission approve, payout) require strict existing backend authority — this control plane must not invent unsafe write paths.
11. Server-side permission/capability checks required — UI hiding is not security.
12. Authenticated Production proof required before `PRODUCTION_READY`.
13. Do not incompatibly change auth/MFA, APP tenant boundary, shared-host routing, CORE.APPROVAL, Website Kompis runtime, secret/vault, or payment/invoice/partner accounting integrity.

